Overall vulnerability rank in the previous assessment was High [@hare2016vulnerability].

## Data Quality Metrics

### Life History Data Quality:

95% of data quality scores were greater than or equal to 2, indicating excellent data quality. No data gaps (mean attribute data quality score \< 2) were identified.

### Model Confidence Score:

The black sea bass ensemble model received a 1.7 (+/- 0.4) model confidence score, indicating low confidence in the model. Experts stated that the model described black sea bass distributions well, particularly in the Mid-Atlantic, but did not represent the recent northern range expansion. The ensemble model AUC was 0.93, indicating excellent model performance. 

